<main class="write-main"><div class="writer-head"><div><span class="writer-kicker">Mail acceptance</span><h1>Check delivery to your own inbox.</h1></div><a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/operations')?>">Operations</a></div><section class="studio-panel"><p>This sends one branded test to the email on your signed-in Writer account: <strong><?=e(current_user()['email'])?></strong>. It does not process the outbox, release newsletters or enable background work.</p><?php if($result):?><p role="status"><?=e($result)?></p><?php endif;?><p>Transport: <?=email_transport_ready()?'Configured':'Paused'?>. Check the inbox, spam folder, greeting, header, social links and plain-text alternative. Use Google Email Log Search to investigate rejection or delivery.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn" type="submit" <?=email_transport_ready()?'':'disabled'?>>Send one test to my Writer email</button></form><p>Repeated requests are held for five minutes. An uncertain outcome is not automatically retried.</p></section></main>
